      {% when 'loss-of-memory' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-loss-of-memory">
<h2>Compare these listings by label, not by a memory promise</h2>
<p>These listings are gathered under memory and attention. Open two or three and read the ingredients, directions, cautions and intended-use text side by side; a catalogue cannot establish that any of them will change memory.</p>
<h3>What to check on each product page</h3>
<ul>
<li>The full ingredient list and the stated intended use.</li>
<li>Directions: quantity, timing, duration and any supervision note.</li>
<li>Cautions, and whether they touch a medicine you take.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Can this collection screen for dementia or another disorder?</summary><p>No. Screening and diagnosis need history, examination and, when indicated, testing.</p></details>
<p>Forgetfulness can follow sleep, stress, mood, medicines, hearing or vision, illness or neurological causes, so an <a href="/pages/online-consultation">online consultation</a> is often the better first step; for separate browsing see <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/insomnia">sleep support</a> or <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/stress">stress-related products</a>. Sudden confusion, trouble speaking, new weakness, severe headache, seizure or a head injury needs urgent medical attention.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'insomnia' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-insomnia">
<h2>Sort these sleep-support listings by format, timing and caution</h2>
<p>Decide first which problem you are shopping for: trouble falling asleep, repeated waking or early waking. Occasional sleep disruption and persistent insomnia are not the same decision. Use this collection as shopping information, not a diagnosis.</p>
<h3>Read these three lines before adding to cart</h3>
<ul>
<li>Ingredients and dose, and any overlap with what you already take.</li>
<li>Time of use and intended duration, stated product by product.</li>
<li>Drowsiness cautions, if you drive or work early.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>How quickly should a sleep-support product work?</summary><p>No responsible collection-wide timeline exists. Follow the exact label, and get advice if poor sleep continues or worsens.</p></details>
<p>Do not assume two products can be combined; check overlapping ingredients, sedating effects and medicine interactions with a qualified professional. Loud snoring with breathing pauses, heavy daytime sleepiness or a sudden change in sleep needs assessment. See <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/stress">stress-support products</a>, or arrange an <a href="/pages/online-consultation">online consultation</a>.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'ayurvedic-herbal-products-wholesaler-bulk-supplier' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-ayurvedic-herbal-products-wholesaler-bulk-supplier">
<h2>Two ways to buy: the listed bulk pack, or a written quotation</h2>
<p>This trade-facing catalogue includes listed bulk or trade-oriented powders, oils and other lines. If the exact pack is listed, priced and currently buyable, order it like any other item. For a different quantity, or a pack that is not shown, send an enquiry.</p>
<h3>What to put in a bulk enquiry</h3>
<ul>
<li>The exact product title and pack size, not the category name.</li>
<li>Quantity, destination market, buyer type and intended channel.</li>
<li>The terms you need in writing: availability, lead time, price, taxes, delivery, documents, payment.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Does a product appearing here guarantee bulk availability?</summary><p>No. Ask Kairali to confirm the exact item, pack, quantity, destination and supply terms in writing.</p></details>
<p>Bulk listing does not establish classification, export eligibility, certification or private-label availability. Production enquiries belong on <a href="/pages/contract-manufacturing">contract manufacturing</a>, property buyers on <a href="/pages/hotel-resort-and-spa-supply">hotel, resort and spa supply</a>, and exact questions on <a href="/pages/contact-us">Contact Kairali</a>.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'gift-products' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-gift-products">
<h2>What this gift page can and cannot tell you</h2>
<p>Use the live grid as the current source for this visit. If the grid shows nothing, there is nothing to choose here now, and no hidden set or promised date sits behind it. If cards are showing, each is an ordinary product with its own contents, price and terms.</p>
<h3>Choosing for someone else</h3>
<ul>
<li>Open the exact card and read its contents, quantity and price, not an earlier visit.</li>
<li>Check ingredients, warnings and intended use against the recipient's allergies.</li>
<li>Read the current delivery and return information before paying.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Can support promise a date or an item that is not listed?</summary><p>Do not assume so. Ask about the exact need, then rely on the written reply and the checkout information.</p></details>
<p>Do not infer a bundle, wrapping, message service or delivery date that the listing does not state; gifting changes no product restriction. See <a href="/pages/gifting">gifting</a>, and read <a href="/pages/shipping-and-return">shipping information</a> and the <a href="/pages/return-refund-policy">return and refund policy</a> before ordering.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'thailams-wholesale-bulk-packaging' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-thailams-wholesale-bulk-packaging">
<h2>Name the exact Thailam before you discuss supply</h2>
<p>This route lists Thailams and Ayurvedic oils. Similar-sounding titles are not interchangeable: the formulation on the label is the product, not the family name. Fix the exact oil and its listing page first. A listed, priced and currently buyable pack can be ordered as shown; any other quantity needs an enquiry.</p>
<h3>What a useful oil enquiry contains</h3>
<ul>
<li>The exact formulation name and the listing page you are working from.</li>
<li>The pack formats, handling and storage questions you need answered.</li>
<li>The destination and business use, so labels and terms can be checked.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Are wholesale packs available for every oil in the grid?</summary><p>Not necessarily. Formats, quantities, price and serviceability are confirmed per named product.</p></details>
<p>Trade presentation does not establish suitability for a health condition or permission to make medical statements. See <a href="/pages/quality-and-safety">quality and safety information</a>, review <a href="/pages/become-our-distributers-importers">distributor pathways</a>, and send exact questions through <a href="/pages/contact-us">contact support</a>.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'choornams-wholesale-bulk-packaging' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-choornams-wholesale-bulk-packaging">
<h2>Choornams for trade buyers: fix the formulation first</h2>
<p>Choornam and churna both name a powdered preparation, and this route keeps that trade search intent. Treat each powder by its exact formulation name, and treat classical or proprietary status as true only where the product record says so.</p>
<h3>Turning a shortlist into an answerable request</h3>
<ul>
<li>Give the exact formulation name; buy directly only when that listed pack is priced and currently buyable.</li>
<li>State buyer country, business type and intended use, without assuming export or relabelling rights.</li>
<li>Ask for formats, specifications, commercial terms and documents.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Does a grid listing confirm bulk supply or a minimum order?</summary><p>No. It confirms a current public listing only; pack options, quantities and pricing need written confirmation.</p></details>
<p>Bulk wording does not authorise disease claims, repackaging, resale in every destination or deviation from the approved label. Review <a href="/pages/contract-manufacturing">contract manufacturing</a> and <a href="/pages/become-our-distributers-importers">distributor enquiries</a>, then use <a href="/pages/contact-us">contact channels</a>.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'lehams-ayurvedic-herbal-jams' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-lehams-ayurvedic-herbal-jams">
<h2>Lehams and Rasayanams: choose by the complete name</h2>
<p>These are dense semisolid preparations, described as Leham, Lehyam, Gudam or Rasayanam and sometimes called herbal jams. That shared format does not establish ingredients, intended use, dose or suitability. Similarly named preparations are not interchangeable, so match the full name on the label.</p>
<h3>What to compare on the product page</h3>
<ul>
<li>The complete formulation name, and the ingredient list behind it.</li>
<li>Serving directions: quantity, timing, duration, storage and any supervision instruction.</li>
<li>Food sensitivities, sugar intake, pregnancy or feeding, and other medicines.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Does a jam-like format make it an everyday food?</summary><p>Not necessarily. Treat each item as a specific formulation and read its label and serving directions.</p></details>
<p>If the dosage form is the main decision, compare the wider <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/traditional-ayurvedic-medicine">traditional Ayurvedic range</a>, liquid <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/arishtas-and-asavams-or-arishta-and-asava">Arishtas and Asavams</a> or <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/kashayams-ayurvedic-herbal-decoctions">Kashayam decoctions</a>. A sweet texture does not make a preparation suitable for casual use.</p>
</section>
