      {% when 'ayurvedic-hair-oil' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-ayurvedic-hair-oil">
<h2>Pick a hair oil by its directions, not by the family name</h2>
<p>These oils use different botanical formulations and application styles. Two can look alike on the shelf and still ask for a different quantity, contact time and wash-off routine, so read the directions before you compare price.</p>
<h3>Three things that decide the choice</h3>
<ul>
<li>Where it goes: scalp massage, the lengths, or both, as the directions state.</li>
<li>How it is used: quantity, frequency, contact time and the shampooing instruction.</li>
<li>How it fits your week; introduce one new product at a time and patch test when appropriate.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Will hair oil regrow hair or stop shedding?</summary><p>No universal outcome can be promised. Shedding has several possible causes, and suitability depends on the exact label and the person.</p></details>
<p>Stop if marked irritation develops; sudden or patchy hair loss, scalp sores, scaling or pain deserves professional assessment. To widen the comparison, browse <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/hair-care">hair care</a>, read the <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/hair-fall">hair-fall guide</a>, or pair the routine with a <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/best-herbal-shampoo-ayurvedic-herbal-shampoos-to-control-dandruff-hair-fall-and-promote-hair-growth">herbal shampoo</a>.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'books' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-books">
<h2>Choose a book by the task you want to learn</h2>
<p>These titles cover subjects such as Ayurvedic cooking, wellness recipes and massage traditions. Decide whether you want something to cook from, to practise from, or to give.</p>
<h3>How to compare the titles above</h3>
<ul>
<li>Cooking and recipes: recipe style, intended reader, and how preparation is explained.</li>
<li>Massage traditions: scope, stated boundaries, and whether a technique needs supervision.</li>
<li>Reference or gifting: author, language, format and edition, confirmed on the product page.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Can a book tell me which product or therapy is right for me?</summary><p>It can give general education; personal suitability still needs current product information and professional assessment.</p></details>
<p>Educational material cannot account for allergies, medicines, pregnancy, acute injury or an individual health condition; a book is not a diagnosis. Read about <a href="/pages/the-kairali-group">the Kairali Group</a> and its <a href="/pages/research-and-development">research and development</a>, or <a href="/pages/contact-us">contact Kairali</a> with edition questions.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'best-herbal-shampoo-ayurvedic-herbal-shampoos-to-control-dandruff-hair-fall-and-promote-hair-growth' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-best-herbal-shampoo-ayurvedic-herbal-shampoos-to-control-dandruff-hair-fall-and-promote-hair-growth">
<h2>Start with your scalp, then compare the formulas</h2>
<p>These shampoos are positioned for different cleansing routines and hair feels, and their ingredients and fragrance vary by formula. The shared word herbal says nothing about what one is free from, so the comparison begins with your own scalp.</p>
<h3>Narrowing the shortlist</h3>
<ul>
<li>Name the scalp you are shopping for: oily, dry, flaking or easily irritated.</li>
<li>Read the formula: cleansing ingredients, botanicals, fragrance, directions and contact time.</li>
<li>Judge the routine: wash frequency, rinsing, and whether lengths need conditioning.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Can shampoo alone stop hair fall?</summary><p>No universal promise is appropriate. Cleansing supports a routine, but sudden or persistent shedding needs its cause assessed.</p></details>
<p>No collection-wide claim about sulphates, parabens, dandruff, hair fall or growth applies; only the individual label speaks for its product. Browse all <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/hair-care">hair care</a>, compare guidance for <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/dandruff">dandruff</a>, or add a <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/ayurvedic-hair-oil">hair oil</a> when its directions suit the same routine.</p>
</section>
      {% when 'herbal-soap-best-natural-handmade-herbal-soap-for-healthy-glowing-skin' %}
<section class="kairali-collection-guide" data-guide="in034-b07-herbal-soap-best-natural-handmade-herbal-soap-for-healthy-glowing-skin">
<h2>Cleansing bars, compared by ingredients and skin feel</h2>
<p>This range includes individual cleansing bars and a multi-soap set. Botanical ingredients and essential oils change from bar to bar, so compare two named formulas, not herbal soap against ordinary soap.</p>
<h3>Before you choose a bar</h3>
<ul>
<li>Read the ingredient list for fragrance, essential oils and anything you already react to.</li>
<li>Check the stated area of use, whether body, face or general cleansing, and avoid the eye area.</li>
<li>Decide the format: a single bar, or a set whose contents you have inspected.</li>
</ul>
<details><summary>Is a herbal soap automatically gentle?</summary><p>No. Plant-derived ingredients and fragrance can still irritate some skin. The exact formula and your own sensitivity matter more than the category word.</p></details>
<p>Patch test when appropriate, rinse thoroughly, and stop use if significant irritation develops; persistent redness, broken skin or a widespread rash needs professional advice. Continue with <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/body-care">body care</a>, or compare routines for <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/dry-skin">dry skin</a> and <a href="{{ routes.collections_url }}/oily-skin">oily skin</a>.</p>
</section>
